00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.370
We want this or that.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.940
And we'll talk about how that
works in a Firebase world.

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:52.100
Then we'll talk about
monitoring and kind of dive

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:55.550
into how do we get
confidence in what's

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.010
