00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.000
the right thing on your behalf.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:09.020
And so we'll talk about how
you can keep an eye on us,

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:12.000
ensure that what we're doing on
your behalf is what you want.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.170
This is things like uptime and
